WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.867
So the U.S.

00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:01.201
has now

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:02.402
confronted China

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:04.170
face to face over the suspected

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.438
Chinese spy balloon

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:07.273
shot down by the US two weeks ago.

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:08.241
And it happened Saturday

00:00:08.241 --> 00:00:09.109
on the sidelines

00:00:09.109 --> 00:00:10.710
of the Munich Security Conference

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:11.311
between US

00:00:11.311 --> 00:00:12.045
Secretary of State

00:00:12.045 --> 00:00:13.313
Antony Blinken

00:00:13.313 --> 00:00:15.415
and Wang Yi, China's top diplomat.

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:17.384
Afterward, Blinken tweeted,

00:00:17.384 --> 00:00:19.052
I condemn the incursion

00:00:19.052 --> 00:00:20.854
of the PRC surveillance

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:22.489
balloon and stressed

00:00:22.489 --> 00:00:24.691
it must never happen again.

00:00:24.691 --> 00:00:25.425
China claims

00:00:25.425 --> 00:00:26.526
a large balloon was

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:28.795
in fact a civilian research project

00:00:28.795 --> 00:00:30.063
that crossed into U.S.

00:00:30.063 --> 00:00:32.132
airspace by accident.

00:00:32.132 --> 00:00:33.600
The US allowed it to float

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:34.367
through the country

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:35.568
for several days

00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:36.770
before shooting it down

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:38.638
off the coast of South Carolina.

00:00:38.638 --> 00:00:39.472
On Saturday,

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:42.175
Wang was asked to comment on the downing

00:00:42.175 --> 00:00:42.909
of the balloon.

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:44.310
Here's what he said

00:00:45.512 --> 00:00:48.581
We asked the United States to handle it

00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:51.251
calmly and professionally

00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:53.086
based on consultation with

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:53.953
the Chinese side.

00:00:57.824 --> 00:00:59.459
Regrettably,

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:03.496
the United States disregards these facts

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:06.466
and use advanced

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:09.936
fighter jets and downed a balloon

00:01:10.703 --> 00:01:13.973
with its missiles.

00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:15.508
This is, I would say,

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:18.378
absurd and hysterical,

00:01:18.378 --> 00:01:19.813
absurd and hysterical.

00:01:19.813 --> 00:01:20.380
CNN's

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:21.981
Nic Robertson is covering the conference

00:01:21.981 --> 00:01:22.982
for us in Munich.

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:23.583
And CNN's

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:24.751
Mark Stewart is standing

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:26.853
by for us in Tokyo with more from there.

00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:27.754
Nic, to you first.

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:29.622
The meeting between Blinken and Wang

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:31.858
was contentious for sure,

00:01:31.858 --> 00:01:33.827
but did it clear the air

00:01:33.827 --> 00:01:36.463
in terms of serving to reestablish

00:01:36.463 --> 00:01:40.133
an important dialog for both countries?

00:01:40.567 --> 00:01:41.468
Well, I think the language

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:42.602
that's been used subsequently

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:43.970
by the State Department,

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:46.206
not calling it a spy balloon,

00:01:46.573 --> 00:01:48.208
avoiding that kind of language

00:01:48.208 --> 00:01:49.609
for the Chinese is inflammatory

00:01:49.609 --> 00:01:50.743
because, of course, they deny

00:01:50.743 --> 00:01:51.878
that it was a spy balloon.

00:01:51.878 --> 00:01:53.379
It was meteorological

00:01:54.481 --> 00:01:54.914
balloon.

00:01:54.914 --> 00:01:57.283
That's that's what they've been saying.

00:01:58.218 --> 00:02:01.020
But, look, I think that President Biden

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:02.422
has taken a huge amount

00:02:02.422 --> 00:02:04.057
of domestic political heat

00:02:04.057 --> 00:02:05.024
over this, particularly

00:02:05.024 --> 00:02:06.159
because the balloon was allowed

00:02:06.159 --> 00:02:08.495
to fly across the United States before

00:02:08.495 --> 00:02:09.295
it was shot down.

00:02:09.295 --> 00:02:11.131
The administration has been very strong

00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:12.632
and very clear

00:02:12.632 --> 00:02:13.533
that it did this

00:02:13.533 --> 00:02:15.135
because it believed that

00:02:15.135 --> 00:02:16.536
to shoot the balloon down

00:02:16.536 --> 00:02:19.172
above the United States could potentially

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:22.809
spray debris or cause debris

00:02:22.809 --> 00:02:23.510
to fall down

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:24.611
and potentially injure

00:02:24.611 --> 00:02:25.945
people on the ground.

00:02:25.945 --> 00:02:27.180
So I think the language

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:27.847
that we're hearing

00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:29.816
from Secretary of State

00:02:29.816 --> 00:02:31.618
Blinken, this very strong

00:02:31.618 --> 00:02:33.486
condemnation of China's

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:34.621
balloon entering U.S.

00:02:34.621 --> 00:02:36.723
airspace, a violation of sovereignty,

00:02:36.723 --> 00:02:38.591
breaking international law.

00:02:38.591 --> 00:02:40.994
That's an indication

00:02:40.994 --> 00:02:43.396
of the tough response that,

00:02:43.463 --> 00:02:45.298
if you will, politically demanded

00:02:45.298 --> 00:02:46.432
in the United States.

00:02:46.432 --> 00:02:48.134
Diplomatic as well.

00:02:48.134 --> 00:02:49.502
Yes, but there's

00:02:49.502 --> 00:02:51.171
there is a political element to this.

00:02:51.171 --> 00:02:52.605
But I think some of the other language

00:02:52.605 --> 00:02:54.607
has also been very tough,

00:02:54.607 --> 00:02:56.843
a very tough warning for China about

00:02:56.843 --> 00:02:59.279
if it further supports

00:02:59.279 --> 00:03:01.314
Russia and its war in Ukraine.

00:03:01.314 --> 00:03:03.783
Concerns were raised here by

00:03:03.783 --> 00:03:07.220
by the vice president and by six

00:03:07.487 --> 00:03:07.854
time state

00:03:07.854 --> 00:03:09.389
Blinken with allies

00:03:09.389 --> 00:03:10.823
telling their European partners

00:03:10.823 --> 00:03:11.791
that they're concerned

00:03:11.791 --> 00:03:15.728
that China is has a disturbing

00:03:15.728 --> 00:03:16.863
trend line

00:03:16.863 --> 00:03:19.265
towards upping its support for Russia.

00:03:19.566 --> 00:03:20.500
That this is

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:22.135
it appears that China can be

00:03:22.135 --> 00:03:23.636
sort of walking up to a line

00:03:23.636 --> 00:03:24.604
that it might cross

00:03:24.604 --> 00:03:27.473
whereby it will give military support to

00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:28.975
to Russia.

00:03:28.975 --> 00:03:30.043
And that's a concern.

00:03:30.043 --> 00:03:31.077
And there were strong warnings

00:03:31.077 --> 00:03:32.045
in the meeting about that.

00:03:32.045 --> 00:03:32.946
And we will get to

00:03:32.946 --> 00:03:33.580
that issue in a minute.

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:34.347
I want to go to Mark,

00:03:34.347 --> 00:03:35.415
though, in Tokyo

00:03:35.415 --> 00:03:36.583
just to talk about China's

00:03:36.583 --> 00:03:37.450
reaction to this.

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:39.219
We know China is reasserting itself

00:03:39.219 --> 00:03:40.620
on the global stage

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:42.822
now that it seems of its claims

00:03:42.822 --> 00:03:43.990
it's conquered COVID.

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:45.491
But what could this mean for us?

00:03:45.491 --> 00:03:47.227
China relations going forward

00:03:50.363 --> 00:03:52.532
Well, I mean, as you well know, Paula,

00:03:52.532 --> 00:03:54.834
we may never know the true scope

00:03:54.834 --> 00:03:57.036
of the COVID situation.

00:03:57.036 --> 00:03:59.072
The impact on people in China

00:03:59.072 --> 00:04:00.006
and that's based off of what

00:04:00.006 --> 00:04:00.673
we have heard

00:04:00.673 --> 00:04:02.675
from the World Health Organization.

00:04:02.675 --> 00:04:03.810
It's based off of what we've heard

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:05.278
from medical experts.

00:04:05.278 --> 00:04:06.346
We also know

00:04:06.346 --> 00:04:07.480
that China has had

00:04:07.480 --> 00:04:09.549
a lot of economic hardship

00:04:09.549 --> 00:04:10.450
because of COVID.

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:11.718
I'm talking about supply chain

00:04:11.718 --> 00:04:13.086
issues, manufacturing,

00:04:13.086 --> 00:04:15.221
even the stress on local governments,

00:04:15.521 --> 00:04:16.522
quite frankly,

00:04:16.522 --> 00:04:18.691
in order to have economic success

00:04:18.758 --> 00:04:20.927
You need diplomatic success.

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:21.728
And both

00:04:21.728 --> 00:04:22.562
the United States

00:04:22.562 --> 00:04:25.331
and China are invested in each other.

00:04:25.531 --> 00:04:27.900
Perhaps this declaration is saying,

00:04:28.134 --> 00:04:30.236
yes, China is open for business,

00:04:30.403 --> 00:04:33.539
but to perhaps it is leaving some room

00:04:33.539 --> 00:04:35.375
for some more diplomatic,

00:04:35.375 --> 00:04:37.210
political negotiations.

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:37.677
At least

00:04:37.677 --> 00:04:39.212
that may be one way

00:04:39.212 --> 00:04:40.680
to interpret this, Paula.

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:41.114
And it seemed

00:04:41.114 --> 00:04:41.347
that they

00:04:41.347 --> 00:04:43.149
had to at least come face to face

00:04:43.149 --> 00:04:43.783
on this issue

00:04:43.783 --> 00:04:45.418
before they could go on the others.

00:04:45.418 --> 00:04:46.486
I want to go back to something

00:04:46.486 --> 00:04:47.320
Nic was alluding to.

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:49.088
I want you to hear now from Wang himself

00:04:49.088 --> 00:04:50.823
talking about Ukraine. Let's listen

00:04:52.792 --> 00:04:53.860
We need

00:04:54.294 --> 00:04:56.863
to think calmly, especially our friends

00:04:56.863 --> 00:04:58.064
in Europe.

00:05:00.466 --> 00:05:03.303
About what efforts should be made

00:05:04.837 --> 00:05:07.407
to stop the warfare.

00:05:07.407 --> 00:05:09.208
What framework

00:05:10.143 --> 00:05:10.610
should there

00:05:10.610 --> 00:05:13.179
be to bring lasting peace to Europe?

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:14.947
So, Nick,

00:05:14.947 --> 00:05:16.416
how was those kinds of comments

00:05:16.416 --> 00:05:17.950
received by both Europe

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:19.986
and the United States, especially since,

00:05:19.986 --> 00:05:20.820
as you mentioned,

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:23.056
the US is now coming out with its theory

00:05:23.056 --> 00:05:23.623
that, look,

00:05:23.623 --> 00:05:25.992
we believe that China may attempt

00:05:25.992 --> 00:05:27.260
to materially

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:28.294
support Russia

00:05:28.294 --> 00:05:30.697
in its conflict with Ukraine.

00:05:31.564 --> 00:05:33.333
You know, I think they're being treated

00:05:33.333 --> 00:05:34.300
with skepticism.

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:36.803
I think they're being treated with

00:05:36.803 --> 00:05:38.171
actions are going to speak louder

00:05:38.171 --> 00:05:38.705
than words.

00:05:38.705 --> 00:05:39.872
And and

00:05:39.872 --> 00:05:41.140
following on from those comments,

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:42.475
that Wang Yi

00:05:43.076 --> 00:05:45.378
made that he went on to say that

00:05:45.812 --> 00:05:48.348
legitimate security concerns

00:05:48.348 --> 00:05:50.416
must be addressed in this in this deal.

00:05:50.416 --> 00:05:52.685
And I think to European and us is

00:05:52.952 --> 00:05:56.055
that sounds like saying that Russia's.

00:05:57.623 --> 00:05:58.591
Russia's pretext,

00:05:58.591 --> 00:05:59.826
President Putin's pretext

00:05:59.826 --> 00:06:00.393
for invading

00:06:00.393 --> 00:06:01.794
Ukraine that he was concerned

00:06:01.794 --> 00:06:04.163
about NATO's expansion,

00:06:04.163 --> 00:06:06.099
although he has gone in and killed

00:06:06.099 --> 00:06:08.634
thousands upon thousands of Ukrainians

00:06:08.634 --> 00:06:09.602
and destroyed

00:06:09.602 --> 00:06:10.670
much of the infrastructure

00:06:10.670 --> 00:06:12.038
in the country.

00:06:12.472 --> 00:06:15.375
That that this does not align

00:06:15.375 --> 00:06:15.775
with what

00:06:15.775 --> 00:06:17.610
the Europeans in the US understands

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:19.979
with the real reasons for Putin's

00:06:19.979 --> 00:06:21.447
rationale to go into Ukraine.

00:06:21.447 --> 00:06:23.116
So when China says

00:06:23.116 --> 00:06:24.617
legitimate security concerns

00:06:24.617 --> 00:06:25.585
must be addressed.

00:06:25.585 --> 00:06:26.886
It will sound very much

00:06:26.886 --> 00:06:28.521
as if it's sort of taking Russia's

00:06:28.521 --> 00:06:29.622
corner on this.

00:06:29.622 --> 00:06:31.124
And this was part of the message

00:06:31.124 --> 00:06:32.492
that the White House

00:06:32.492 --> 00:06:33.793
and the State Department were spreading

00:06:33.793 --> 00:06:34.961
among allies here,

00:06:34.961 --> 00:06:35.962
that on the one hand,

00:06:35.962 --> 00:06:36.829
it may appear that

00:06:36.829 --> 00:06:39.232
China is speaking about peace moves

00:06:39.432 --> 00:06:41.467
and that it may be making these overtures

00:06:41.467 --> 00:06:43.169
about being a sort of a peace broker.

00:06:43.169 --> 00:06:44.404
But behind the scenes,

00:06:44.404 --> 00:06:47.073
they are quietly increasing their support

00:06:47.073 --> 00:06:47.774
for Russia.

00:06:47.774 --> 00:06:49.809
Now, it has to be clearly said

00:06:49.809 --> 00:06:51.010
that there is no evidence

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:51.978
that's being put forward

00:06:51.978 --> 00:06:52.545
that Russia

00:06:52.545 --> 00:06:53.846
that China is giving

00:06:53.846 --> 00:06:55.915
military aid to Russia.

00:06:55.915 --> 00:06:57.383
It would be a game changer.

00:06:57.383 --> 00:06:58.084
And I spoke yesterday

00:06:58.084 --> 00:06:58.651
with the European

00:06:58.651 --> 00:06:59.519
Commission President

00:06:59.519 --> 00:07:00.019
Ursula von

00:07:00.019 --> 00:07:00.353
der Leyen,

00:07:00.353 --> 00:07:01.654
and I asked her about this

00:07:01.654 --> 00:07:02.522
particular issue

00:07:02.522 --> 00:07:03.423
and she said

00:07:03.423 --> 00:07:05.725
this is something we're concerned about.

00:07:05.725 --> 00:07:08.461
It's an open issue on the table.

00:07:08.461 --> 00:07:09.028
She said

00:07:09.028 --> 00:07:10.997
whether or not or what level of support

00:07:10.997 --> 00:07:12.865
China is giving to Russia.

00:07:12.865 --> 00:07:14.167
But it's certainly something

00:07:14.167 --> 00:07:16.002
that European nations

00:07:16.002 --> 00:07:16.836
are concerned about.

00:07:16.836 --> 00:07:17.236
And Jens

00:07:17.236 --> 00:07:18.104
Stoltenberg,

00:07:18.104 --> 00:07:19.071
NATO's secretary

00:07:19.071 --> 00:07:19.739
general, spoke

00:07:19.739 --> 00:07:21.274
about it as well yesterday.

00:07:21.274 --> 00:07:23.142
Yeah, everyone seemed to be quite candid.

00:07:23.142 --> 00:07:23.576
And given

00:07:23.576 --> 00:07:25.511
that Mark is expected, in fact,

00:07:25.511 --> 00:07:27.413
to travel to Russia in the coming days,

00:07:27.413 --> 00:07:29.348
what's the expectation there

00:07:29.348 --> 00:07:31.217
especially since China has made it clear

00:07:31.217 --> 00:07:32.318
it wants to strengthen

00:07:32.318 --> 00:07:33.219
its bond with Russia,

00:07:33.219 --> 00:07:34.187
at least economically

00:07:34.187 --> 00:07:35.955
and strategically in its own sphere.

00:07:39.158 --> 00:07:39.559
Right.

00:07:39.559 --> 00:07:40.893
And I think just to pick up on

00:07:40.893 --> 00:07:41.360
also what

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:42.462
Nick was saying, this

00:07:42.462 --> 00:07:45.665
this idea that that that China

00:07:45.665 --> 00:07:47.733
is publicly saying it's for peace,

00:07:47.733 --> 00:07:49.502
but privately doing something else.

00:07:49.502 --> 00:07:51.204
I mean, a lot of those allegations

00:07:51.204 --> 00:07:52.371
are being made

00:07:52.371 --> 00:07:54.540
based off of you with US intelligence.

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:54.874
That's what

00:07:54.874 --> 00:07:56.642
the State Department is saying.

00:07:56.642 --> 00:07:58.377
And that it is sharing

00:07:58.377 --> 00:08:01.247
those those intelligence findings

00:08:01.914 --> 00:08:04.317
with with with their counterparts

00:08:04.317 --> 00:08:06.219
in the E.U.

00:08:06.219 --> 00:08:08.654
I think moving forward,

00:08:08.654 --> 00:08:11.057
China has been given a very firm warning,

00:08:11.591 --> 00:08:11.858
at least

00:08:11.858 --> 00:08:12.792
according to a State

00:08:12.792 --> 00:08:13.993
Department spokesperson,

00:08:13.993 --> 00:08:15.995
that if it does pursue these channels,

00:08:16.262 --> 00:08:18.231
there will be consequences.

00:08:18.231 --> 00:08:19.699
There will be ramifications.

00:08:19.699 --> 00:08:21.234
I mean, I think that's the big takeaway,

00:08:21.234 --> 00:08:22.535
at least from the State Department

00:08:22.535 --> 00:08:24.403
towards China is saying

00:08:24.403 --> 00:08:26.772
China take notice, were warning you now.

